    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Mnemonic Spillway.</strong> Your thoughts overflow into the world, leaving echoes others can feel.</p><p>At the end of each short or a Soma Break, choose one Spillway:</p><ul><li><strong>Memory Marker:</strong> You leave a metaphysical imprint at your rest site. You and allies gain +2 on checks to retrace steps to this location, and you faintly sense when a hostile creature passes through it.</li><li><strong>Symbol Trace:</strong> You leave a dream-symbol on a creature you interacted with. You reroll the lowest die on Insight (Soul) checks toward that creature for 24 hours, and you subtly sense deceit or emotional tension.</li><li><strong>Pathway Echo:</strong> You attune to the next hex you plan to travel to. The next Travel hazard is treated as one tier lower, or ignored if already minor.</li><li><strong>Faction Ripple:</strong> If you interacted with a faction, you gain +1 Soft Power OP or +1 Intrigue OP the next time you make an OP test against that faction.</li></ul>",
